    "OpenAI project ID": "ID projekta OpenAI",
    "Calls are bridged to sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.": "Klici so povezani na sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.",
    "Allowed countries": "Dovoljene države",
    "Countries calls may be placed to, as comma-separated ISO codes such as GB, US. Applied to the selected provider when changed, and by its setup button.": "Države, v katere je dovoljeno klicati, kot kode ISO, ločene z vejicami, npr. GB, US. Uveljavi se za izbranega ponudnika ob spremembi in z njegovim gumbom za nastavitev.",
    "Telnyx connection ID": "ID povezave Telnyx",
    "The Telnyx voice application calls are placed through. \"Set up Telnyx\" creates it for you; its webhook URL is kept up to date automatically.": "Glasovna aplikacija Telnyx, prek katere se izvajajo klici. \"Nastavi Telnyx\" jo ustvari namesto vas; njen URL webhooka se samodejno posodablja.",
    "Set up Telnyx": "Nastavi Telnyx",
    "Creates the voice application and outbound profile through the Telnyx API, then verifies the From number as caller ID by SMS code.": "Ustvari glasovno aplikacijo in odhodni profil prek API-ja Telnyx, nato pa s kodo SMS preveri številko pošiljatelja kot ID klicatelja.",
    "Set up Twilio": "Nastavi Twilio",
    "Enables the allowed countries and points the From number at the webhook through the Twilio API, then verifies the From number as caller ID with a call from Twilio if the account does not own it.": "Omogoči dovoljene države in prek API-ja Twilio usmeri številko pošiljatelja na webhook, nato pa s klicem Twilio preveri številko pošiljatelja kot ID klicatelja, če je račun nima v lasti.",
    "Public URL": "Javni URL",
    "Filled in automatically: a Cloudflare quick tunnel is opened to the listener whenever a provider is set, and OpenAI and the provider are pointed at it.": "Izpolni se samodejno: ko je nastavljen ponudnik, se odpre hitri tunel Cloudflare do poslušalca, OpenAI in ponudnik pa se usmerita nanj.",
